				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_018.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_018_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_018.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tyranno_type1_017.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_017.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					完成：2020年10月<br />
					ワンフェス2020冬に入手したものを完成させたもの。<br />
					当時の復元、とはいえかっこいい。</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_016.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_016.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tyranno_type1_013.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_013.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					このキット、歯がイマイチなんですよね。塗装でごまかしています。<br />
					確かに頭の雰囲気が我々がよく知るティラノとちょっと違う。<br />
					</td>
				</tr>
								<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="../../../blog/img2019/blog20190721_047.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="../../../blog/img2019/blog20190721_047_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/blog/img2019/blog20190721_047.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					これはホビー館四万十で展示されていたもの。なんか倒れそうだな・・・。</td>
				</tr>

				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					以下、パーツチェックと製作記。</td>
				</tr>

				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_012.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_012_small.jpg" width="378" /></a></td>
				</tr>

				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					購入したのは<a href="../../../blog/blog20200209.html">ワンフェス2020冬</a>。</td>
				</tr>
								<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_001.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tyranno_type1_002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_002.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					再販版のパッケージは、当時のパッケージの表紙のカラーコピーが貼り付けられています。<br />
					</td>
				</tr>

				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_003.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_003.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tyranno_type1_012.jpg"><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_012.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					全8パーツ。金型は当時と同じものらしいので、パーツの構成も同じのはず。</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_004.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_004.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tyranno_type1_005.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_005_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_005.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					上あごは入れ歯方式。これ以降のキットでは上あごと下あごで分割されます。</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_008.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_008.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tyranno_type1_007.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_007_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_007.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					松村さんのティラノキットの背中にはトゲがよくありますが、これにはありません。</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_009.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_009.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_011.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_011_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_011.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tyranno_type1_010.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tyranno_type1_010_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_010.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					このソフビ、えらいふにゃふにゃなんですよね。</td>
				</tr>
																						
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_022.jpg">
					<img height="212" src="img/tyranno_type1_022_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_022.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tyranno_type1_023.jpg"><img height="212" src="img/tyranno_type1_023_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_023.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
																						
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					いつもどおり煮ます。<br />
					今回は補強のため、レジンを買ってきました。</td>
				</tr>
								<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_024.jpg">
					<img height="212" src="img/tyranno_type1_024_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_024.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tyranno_type1_027.jpg"><img height="212" src="img/tyranno_type1_027_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/dinoland/35tyrannosaursType1/img/tyranno_type1_027.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>
																						
				<tr>
					<td class="comment">
					頭部と両脚、尻尾にはレジンを完全に充填。<br />
					胴体は完全に充填すると重くなってしまうので、コーティングするイメージでうっすら固めてあります。<br />
					これで強度に問題はなし。</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>
					<a href="img/tyranno_type1_019.jpg">
